sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant WS as WebSocket API
    participant C as Context Builder
    participant L as LLM Adapter
    participant T as Tool Executor

    U->>WS: Send message with JWT
    WS->>C: Build static and dynamic context
    C-->>WS: System and user context
    WS->>L: Stream model request
    L-->>WS: Text chunk or tool call
    WS-->>U: Stream status
    WS->>T: Execute requested tool
    T-->>WS: Structured result
    WS->>L: Append tool result
    L-->>WS: Final answer
    WS-->>U: Complete response
